msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:33
msgid "Events from custom fields: upcoming events, event details with calendar links, and the weekly preview."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:49
msgid "List upcoming events"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:50
msgid "Lists the published events in a period, sorted by start, with date, time (doors and start), venue, image, ticket link and calendar links. Returns the same information visitors see on the website."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:73
msgid "Get event details"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:74
msgid "Returns one published event by post ID or page URL: date, time (doors and start), venue and address, description, image, ticket link and calendar links."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:91
msgid "Get the weekly preview"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:92
msgid "Returns the weekly preview: the events of the coming days and the events newly added to the programme, as structured data, as Telegram text and as e-mail HTML. \"now\" shows it as if it went out now, \"current\" is the latest issue, \"next\" the upcoming one."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:124
msgid "Post the weekly preview to Telegram"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-abilities.php:125
msgid "Posts the weekly preview, as it would look now, to the configured Telegram chat. Visible to all members of that chat. Does not change the weekly schedule. Ask the person before using it."
msgstr ""

